<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 9.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 9.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Dec 9	 Dec 6	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  244.440     242.810     237.040    3.12 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.000     303.950     303.640    0.12 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.450     157.770     165.490   -4.86 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.608	46.674	48.410   -3.72 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  401.600     398.440     366.280    9.64 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.420     140.655     147.886   -5.05 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.979	15.966	14.975    6.70 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.840     216.150     230.135   -6.21 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.871	 1.874	 1.939   -3.51 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.559	 1.561	 1.575   -1.02 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  184.900     186.335     206.030  -10.26 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
